'''Bamboo Hill''' (Japanese: '''バンブーヒル''' ''Bamboo Hill'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Alola]] [[region]], found on [[Melemele Island]]. It appeared in ''[[SM069|Rise and Shine, Starship!]]''.

In the episode, {{an|Sophocles}} went camping there with [[Sophocles's parents|his parents]] and {{TP|Sophocles|Togedemaru}}. During that time, he came across a {{DL|Ultra Beasts (anime)|Celesteela}}, which was stuck in the ground. The next day, after informing {{ashcl}}, they went to see Celesteela. With the help of a group of {{p|Grubbin}}, the group began to excavate around Celesteela. Sophocles believed Celesteela to be the Celestial Starship from legends, but the others believed it to be an {{an|Ultra Beasts|Ultra Beast}}.

They returned the next day after learning from {{an|Lusamine}} that it was indeed an Ultra Beast. Attempts were made to catch it in a [[Beast Ball]], but all of them were unsuccessful due to its large size and the fact that it was still rooted down to the ground. After protecting Celesteela from {{TRT}}, the [[Ultra Guardians]] were able to create a safe area for Celesteela to launch back home.

